.DS_Store

# ── FP-092 ROOT SECRET/IMAGE BLOCK — installed 2026-09-05 (master plan PART II §9) ──────────────
# A screenshot of an API key is the one secret that walks past every gate we have. The secret gate
# greps TEXT; a PNG has none. The block below is UNCONDITIONAL and ROOT-ONLY (the leading `/`), so
# it stops the repo-root drop zone without touching images a project legitimately tracks in
# subdirectories. Removing a line here re-opens FP-092 — `system-coverage.py` fails the repo if the
# block disappears, and `guards-local.sh` checks every repo on the machine.
/Screenshot*
/screenshot*
/Screen?Shot*
/*.heic
/*.HEIC
/*.heif
/*.HEIF
/secrets*
/Secrets*
/keys*
/Keys*
/*.pem
/*.p12
/*.pfx
/*.key
/id_rsa
/id_rsa.*
/id_ed25519
/id_ed25519.*
/*.mobileprovision
/*.p8
# ── end FP-092 block ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
